icular, every value of ${(\\frac{15}{4})}^{1-x}$ is greater than $-9.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{15}{4})}^{1-x}>-9\n$$\n\nfor all real values of $x.$\n\nHence, the original inequality is satisfied for all real numbers." 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299747 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299748 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299749 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299750 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299751 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1041 "selection" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1104 #edb/ref 17592186299747 13194139534628 true] [17592186299746 1110 #uuid "b7d7ce77-d77b-54f4-865d-0d8e114b1c9d" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299747 1034 "all real numbers" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299747 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534628 true] [17592186299747 1111 #uuid "8aff37d3-2b04-5246-94e0-3cb18b29d63d" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299748 1034 "x<1-{log}_{15/4}⁡(9)" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299748 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534628 true] [17592186299748 1111 #uuid "7f3bac30-6f27-5e01-900f-93af7ebb1b3c" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299749 1034 "no solutions" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299749 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534628 true] [17592186299749 1111 #uuid "c41bfc32-367b-5f7b-ad16-a7f74b36a678" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299750 1034 "x<1" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299750 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534628 true] [17592186299750 1111 #uuid "98f88f13-96fc-5ebc-94f5-b5fe5a4b853f" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299751 1034 "x>1" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299751 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534628 true] [17592186299751 1111 #uuid "b51e59dc-b463-539a-833d-11e02970e132" 13194139534628 true] [17592186299752 1017 #edb/ref 17592186299753 13194139534628 true] [17592186299752 1089 "q-87895" 13194139534628